{"id": "Ddewmw8PGtf", "title": "Video by wolfofwallst", "description": "People only spend money on three things. If your offer is not one of them, you do not have a business. You have a hobby.\n\n1. Solutions. People pay to make real pain go away. Debt, weight, stress, confusion, loneliness. The bigger the problem, the bigger the check they will write to kill it.\n\n2. Convenience. The biggest companies on earth sell faster, easier, and done for you. People will pay a premium just to stop thinking about something.\n\n3. Experiences. People pay for a feeling and a story they can tell. Status, adventure, belonging. It is why the same person who argues over twenty dollars will spend five thousand without blinking.\n\nThat is the entire list. There is no fourth category.", "channel": "wolfofwallst", "uploader_id": "310923666", "uploader": "Jordan Belfort", "timestamp": 1789846187, "like_count": 47487, "comment_count": 385, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2100923257458653a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 81.204, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-bog2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN43GyBfdbnT3xJXOqVjYtMMe4idtDVQQSTQJh6vRUhscxme0G3jEKhR4Y2yiB-LWebDtVIV2F38O_7qDPbLrrhRkSLLs1RU3Uoecs.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-bog2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=_NcJc1k3S_IQ7kNvwHzWdyD&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=xvNbtNlNXthtvsMmyiueyw&_nc_ss=7ba8c&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQMDt1V0nuyvDADqFieonxUom0OU5IpC6jgCm7BSbOozMQ&oe=6AC9D894", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 81.204, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language":